{"id":"613419","name":"全麦馒头","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613419/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"全麦面粉","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好面粉。","img":"images/613419/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"j酵母用温水化开。","img":"images/613419/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酵母水倒入面粉里面，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/613419/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入适量温水，揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/613419/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面团醒发至2倍大。","img":"images/613419/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉面排气，分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/613419/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"整理成馒头形状。","img":"images/613419/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"二次醒发至，体积明线变大。","img":"images/613419/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火烧17分钟。","img":"images/613419/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关火焖3分钟。","img":"images/613419/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全麦馒头就做好了。","img":"images/613419/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"原味麦香，营养健康。","img":"images/613419/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}